ind":"update","title":"Hotfix v0.1.4","summary":"​Really small hotfix with just two changes:Re-enabled a core component for the tutorial so that the game would actually work when the tutorial was on.​Fixed the social media buttons so that they didn't partially go off-screen.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:50:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040652","verified_at":"2026-10-25T01:28:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5156660-1847286114037730","game_id":"steam-5156660","kind":"announcement","title":"Devblog #5: Origins and Basis of Ordateig Part 3","summary":"I probably should have started mentioning this sooner on Steam, but I've been somewhat consistently writing devblogs about Zaehbet, Draad on other platforms (my website, tumblr, etc), but I've just neglected to post them here as well (oopsies).If you want to check out the other devblogs, here's the link to the game's website, just scroll to the bottom: https://boxronite.dev/video-games/zaehbet-draadAnyways, the actual devblog:Devblog #5: Origins and Basis of Ordateig Part 3Well, we’re nearing th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T19:12:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037730","verified_at":"2026-10-23T21:46:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5156660-1847286114030918","game_id":"steam-5156660","kind":"update","title":"Update v0.1.3","summary":"Middle of Steam Next Fest, and I finally got around to sending out a new update. Have fun!New Features:The promised document viewer, into (hopefully) full working order with translations.New Dialogue:Added dialogue for:The biohazard cabinet.Two different charts.Added a certain lore document somewhere.Changes:Words seen in previous playthroughs are not visible when starting new playthroughs. I could make a justification of lore consistency, but it's just so that future development is easier for m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:21:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030918","verified_at":"2026-10-22T02:40:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5156660-1846651706690678","game_id":"steam-5156660","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes v0.1.2","summary":"I probably should've posted the patch notes here, sooner, instead of only on the Discord server. Ah well, here comes the first update, in the form of v0.1.2 (if you're wondering where v0.1.1 went, that was a quick hotfix to allow the demo to work in the browser).Features (ish)Added short dialogue for clicking on Halei's armband.Adjusted placement of arm clickables and Halei's body, allowing the SOL armband to be clicked.Added support for phrases in the Dictionary.Added automatic capitalization o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:05:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690678","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:32:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5156660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5156660":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5156660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z"},"5330110":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_c